From 75b9f71a1328e490c02bf57de6e81900b6771d4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kyle Havlovitz <kylehav@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:55:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] Preserve Stadium transformations in saved viewer traces

Store the unfrozen mode in match settings and round-trip transformation type, phase and live collision segments through MSLTRACE1. Compare array-valued fields by content so unchanged geometry stays out of delta rows; frozen traces retain their existing stage columns.

Remove the duplicate mode field from match-start provenance. Extend the existing Wasm smoke to round-trip actual frames from all four transformations, verify sparse geometry, and load frozen traces without the new optional match field. Wasm smoke, the legacy example and production browser checks pass.

(cherry picked from upstream commit 52e047224098243a76cde59cd8367385e813e909 onto visual-only/04-shake)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JX71xgnBPBiwucag1mFRr
